{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pirates of the Storm</strong> is a roguelike turn-based strategy game in the spirit of the old and classy games. It immerses you in a dangerous world of pirate adventures. Become the captain of your own ship, recruit a crew, improve your hero, and explore the magical storm that constantly alters your path. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>           </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070860/extras/fb0be7ab9b5bea48f790f790a6a3ab70.poster.avif?t=1747518047\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070860/extras/fb0be7ab9b5bea48f790f790a6a3ab70.webm?t=1747518047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070860/extras/fb0be7ab9b5bea48f790f790a6a3ab70.mp4?t=1747518047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic turn-based strategy</strong> enhanced with modern <strong>roguelike</strong> elements. Fight sea monsters, rival pirates and powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070860/extras/589d99ce9e28cf32422bb28367b8bcd7.poster.avif?t=1747518047\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070860/extras/589d99ce9e28cf32422bb28367b8bcd7.webm?t=1747518047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070860/extras/589d99ce9e28cf32422bb28367b8bcd7.mp4?t=1747518047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sail</strong> through mysterious waters that are <strong>ever-changing</strong>. Each island offers new dangers, quests, and treasures.\u00a0With procedurally generated islands, enemies, and events, no two journeys are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070860/extras/32a0754d7e5df753713a7e27ee5f9984.poster.avif?t=1747518047\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070860/extras/32a0754d7e5df753713a7e27ee5f9984.webm?t=1747518047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070860/extras/32a0754d7e5df753713a7e27ee5f9984.mp4?t=1747518047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit unique crew members,</strong> each with their own abilities and roles. From skilled pirates to sea creatures, every team member plays a critical role!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every playthrough is a chance to rewrite your pirate legend.\u00a0Are you ready to break the endless loop and become the greatest pirate of all time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3070860?t=1747518047","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747518047","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070860/cafd36f3b37a7e634a4029566cc2554e4b7b4c91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747518047","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070860/cafd36f3b37a7e634a4029566cc2554e4b7b4c91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747518047","categories":[{"descrip